    align: An optional `string` from: `"LEFT_RIGHT", "RIGHT_LEFT", "LEFT_LEFT", "RIGHT_RIGHT"`. Defaults to `"RIGHT_LEFT"`.
      Some diagonals are shorter than `max_diag_len` and need to be padded. `align` is
